# The committed dumps — the compiler island and the precompiled prelude —
# are binary (bitcode plus serialized checked state), regenerated by
# scripts/regen-compiler-island.sh and scripts/regen-prelude-bitcode.sh.
# Mark them binary so git never tries to line-diff or text-merge them.
#
# The island's path was `src/compiler_island.bc` until the 2026-08-20 dump
# work renamed it, and this line was not renamed with it — so the attribute
# stopped matching anything at all.
src/compiler_island.typld binary
crates/typelisp-front/src/prelude.typld binary
